            icon:'📡', color:'#f59e0b',
            title:'Brecha Digital',
            desc:'Si el mercado objetivo no tiene smartphones o señal estable. La adopción forzada de un canal digital genera fricción, no la elimina.',
          },
          {
            icon:'⚠️', color:'#f59e0b',
            title:'Riesgo Operativo',
            desc:'FinTechs extranjeras sin representación legal local. Problemas con SAT, liquidación en Quetzales o resolución de disputas pueden paralizarte.',
          },
          {
            icon:'🔄', color:'#94a3b8',
            title:'Proceso Ineficiente',
            desc:'"Automatizar un proceso ineficiente solo genera ineficiencias más rápidas." La tecnología no cura una mala administración.',
          },
        ].map(r => (
          <div class="s-card" style={`border-color:${r.color}30;`}>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;">
              <span style="font-size:1.5em;">{r.icon}</span>
              <div style={`font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:0.65em;color:${r.color};`}>{r.title}</div>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size:0.58em;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">{r.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="s-card-sm" style="margin-top:16px;border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.3);">
        <div style="font-size:0.62em;color:#fcd34d;text-align:center;font-style:italic;">
          "La pregunta no es <em style="color:#f8fafc;">¿usamos FinTech?</em> sino
          <strong style="color:#f8fafc;">¿resuelve esta FinTech específica nuestro problema específico?</strong>"
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════
         S22 · CONCLUSIÓN & Q&A
    ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="center-all bg-grid">
      <span class="slide-label">Conclusión</span>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:4px;">5 Ideas que se llevan</h2>
      <div class="accent-bar" style="margin:12px auto 24px;"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;max-width:700px;width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px;">
        {[
          { n:'01', txt:'El CMg → 0 no es una ventaja técnica: es una revolución del modelo de negocio.', c:'#38bdf8' },
          { n:'02', txt:'Guatemala pasa de 47 a 119 empresas en 5 años — el ecosistema ya es real y creciente.', c:'#10b981' },
          { n:'03', txt:'Las remesas son el caso de uso más urgente: $26.8B y la exención del 1% cambian la ecuación.', c:'#f59e0b' },
          { n:'04', txt:'El Decreto 7-2026 crea la obligación legal de interoperabilidad — el campo de juego se nivela.', c:'#a78bfa' },
          { n:'05', txt:'Implementar FinTech sin ROI claro ni proceso eficiente es automatizar el caos.', c:'#ef4444' },
        ].map(i => (
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;" class="s-card-sm">
            <div style={`font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:0.7em;color:${i.c};flex-shrink:0;`}>{i.n}</div>
            <div style="font-size:0.62em;color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.5;">{i.txt}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="big-stat" style="font-size:2.5em;margin-bottom:4px;">
        Fin<span class="electric">Tech</span>
        <span style="font-size:0.5em;font-weight:300;color:#94a3b8;"> Guatemala </span>
        <span class="electric" style="font-size:0.6em;">2026</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:0.6em;color:#64748b;margin-top:8px;">¿Preguntas? — Usa los ← → para navegar o presiona F para pantalla completa</div>
    </section>


  </div><!-- /slides -->
  </div><!-- /reveal -->


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SCRIPTS
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <!-- Reveal.js Core (síncrono: debe estar definido antes del inline script) -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/reveal.js@5.1.0/dist/reveal.js"></script>

  <script is:inline>
    // ── Inicializar Reveal.js ────────────────────────────────────
    // Todo el código que usa `Reveal` DEBE estar dentro de este listener.
    // El CDN carga síncronamente, pero `window.load` garantiza que el
    // script CDN ya terminó de ejecutarse antes de llamar a Reveal.initialize().
    window.addEventListener('load', function () {

      if (typeof Reveal === 'undefined') {
        console.error('[FinTech] Reveal.js no se cargó desde CDN.');
        // Fallback: mostrar slides apilados verticalmente
        var el = document.querySelector('.reveal');
        if (el) { el.style.visibility = 'visible'; el.style.overflow = 'auto'; }
        return;
      }

      try {
        Reveal.initialize({
          hash:                 true,
          slideNumber:          'c/t',
          controls:             true,
          controlsTutorial:     false,
          progress:             true,
          center:               true,
          transition:           'fade',
          transitionSpeed:      'fast',
          backgroundTransition: 'fade',
          autoAnimateDuration:  0.5,
          keyboard:             true,
          touch:                false,
          // ── mouseWheel: false ────────────────────────────────────
          // La rueda del ratón hace scroll dentro del slide (overflow-y:auto).
          // Para avanzar entre slides: teclas ← → o los botones de control.
          mouseWheel:           false,
          // ── Dimensiones PC 16:9 ──────────────────────────────────
          width:                1280,
          height:               720,
          margin:               0.06,
          minScale:             0.4,
          maxScale:             1.0,
          disableLayout:        false,
          plugins:              [],
        });

        // ── Listeners de Reveal — DENTRO del load callback ────────
        // (Reveal aún no existe fuera de aquí al momento de parsear el script)

        Reveal.addEventListener('ready', function () {
          initGrowthChart();
          initSectorChart();
        });

        // Reinicializar charts al navegar a las slides que los contienen
        Reveal.addEventListener('slidechanged', function (event) {
          var idx = event.indexh;
          if (idx === 9)  initGrowthChart();   // Slide 10: Growth chart
          if (idx === 10) initSectorChart();    // Slide 11: Sector donut
        });

      } catch (err) {
        console.error('[FinTech] Error al inicializar Reveal.js:', err);
      }
    });

    // ── Chart: Growth ────────────────────────────────────────────
    function initGrowthChart() {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('growth-chart');
      if (!canvas || !window.Chart) return;
      if (canvas._chartInstance) return;

      const ctx      = canvas.getContext('2d');
      const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, 260);
      gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(26, 86, 219, 0.5)');
      gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(26, 86, 219, 0.0)');

      canvas._chartInstance = new Chart(ctx, {
        type: 'line',
        data: {
          labels:   ['2021', '2022', '2023', '2024', '2025', '2026'],
          datasets: [{
            label: 'Empresas activas',
            data:  [47, 66, 87, 96, 119, 119],
            borderColor:      '#38BDF8',
            backgroundColor:  gradient,
            borderWidth:      2.5,
            pointBackgroundColor: '#38BDF8',
            pointBorderColor:     '#0A0F1E',
            pointBorderWidth:     2,
            pointRadius:      5,
            pointHoverRadius: 7,
            fill:    true,
            tension: 0.35,
          }],
        },
        options: {
          responsive: true,
          maintainAspectRatio: false,
          scales: {
            x: {
              grid:   { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)' },
              ticks:  { color: '#94a3b8', font: { family: 'Inter', size: 11 } },
              border: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)' },
            },
            y: {
              beginAtZero: false, min: 40,
              grid:   { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)' },
              ticks:  { color: '#94a3b8', font: { family: 'Inter', size: 11 }, stepSize: 20 },
              border: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)' },
            },
          },
          plugins: {
            legend: { display: false },
            tooltip: {
              backgroundColor: '#0D1B4B',
              borderColor: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.3)', borderWidth: 1,
              callbacks: {
                title: (i) => `Año ${i[0].label}`,
                label: (i) => `  ${i.parsed.y} empresas activas`,
              },
              titleFont: { family: 'Montserrat', weight: '700' },
              bodyFont:  { family: 'Inter' },
            },
          },
          animation: { duration: 1200, easing: 'easeInOutQuart' },
        },
      });
    }

    // ── Chart: Sectors Donut ─────────────────────────────────────
    function initSectorChart() {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('sector-chart');
      if (!canvas || !window.Chart) return;
      if (canvas._chartInstance) return;

      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      canvas._chartInstance = new Chart(ctx, {
        type: 'doughnut',
        data: {
          labels: [
            'Pagos Digitales', 'Tech para Inst. Financieras', 'Crédito Digital',
            'Gestión de Finanzas', 'Criptoactivos', 'Insurtech', 'Neobanca', 'Activos Fin.',
          ],
          datasets: [{
            data:            [38.5, 15.9, 15.9, 9.2, 6.7, 5.0, 3.3, 1.7],
            backgroundColor: ['#1A56DB','#0891B2','#38BDF8','#10B981','#F59E0B','#8B5CF6','#EC4899','#6B7280'],
            borderColor:     '#0A0F1E',
            borderWidth:     3,
            hoverOffset:     8,
          }],
        },
        options: {
          responsive: false,
          cutout: '62%',
          plugins: {
            legend:  { display: false },
            tooltip: {
              backgroundColor: '#0D1B4B',
              borderColor: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.3)', borderWidth: 1, padding: 12,
              titleFont: { family: 'Montserrat', size: 12, weight: '700' },
              bodyFont:  { family: 'Inter', size: 11 },
              callbacks: { label: (c) => `  ${c.parsed.toFixed(1)}%` },
            },
          },
          animation: { animateRotate: true, duration: 1200, easing: 'easeInOutQuart' },
        },
      });
    }

    // ── InfoTerm Modal (singleton) ───────────────────────────────
    (function () {
      if (window.__infotermInit) return;
      window.__infotermInit = true;

      const overlay = document.createElement('div');
      overlay.id = 'infoterm-modal';
      overlay.setAttribute('role', 'dialog');
      overlay.setAttribute('aria-modal', 'true');
      overlay.innerHTML = `
        <div id="infoterm-modal-card">
          <div id="infoterm-modal-header">
            <h2 id="infoterm-modal-title"></h2>
            <button id="infoterm-modal-close" aria-label="Cerrar">&times;</button>
          </div>
          <span id="infoterm-modal-tag"></span>
          <div id="infoterm-modal-content" style="margin-top:8px;"></div>
          <div id="infoterm-modal-formula-wrap" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;background:rgba(13,27,75,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.2);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#38bdf8;font-size:1rem;text-align:center;">
            <div id="infoterm-modal-formula"></div>
          </div>
          <div id="infoterm-modal-examples-wrap" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
            <div style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#38bdf8;margin-bottom:6px;">Contexto Guatemala</div>
            <div id="infoterm-modal-examples-text" style="font-size:0.86rem;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.6;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>`;

      const modalStyles = `
        #infoterm-modal {
          position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:99999;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
          padding:1.5rem;background:rgba(10,15,30,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
          opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 0.2s ease;
        }
        #infoterm-modal.is-open { opacity:1;pointer-events:all; }
        #infoterm-modal-card {
          background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d1b4b 0%,#0a0f1e 100%);
          border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.25);border-radius:1.25rem;padding:1.75rem;
          max-width:500px;width:100%;max-height:80vh;overflow-y:auto;
          box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(26,86,219,0.35);
          transform:scale(0.95) translateY(8px);transition:transform 0.2s ease;
          font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#e2e8f0;
        }
        #infoterm-modal.is-open #infoterm-modal-card { transform:scale(1) translateY(0); }
        #infoterm-modal-header { display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem; }
        #infoterm-modal-title  { font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#f8fafc;line-height:1.3; }
        #infoterm-modal-close  {
          flex-shrink:0;width:2rem;height:2rem;border-radius:0.5rem;
          border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
          color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
          cursor:pointer;font-size:1.2rem;transition:all 0.15s;
        }
        #infoterm-modal-close:hover { background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:#ef4444;border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.3); }
        #infoterm-modal-tag {
          display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:0.2rem 0.65rem;border-radius:999px;
          font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid;
        }
        #infoterm-modal-content { font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;color:#cbd5e1; }
        #infoterm-modal-content strong { color:#f8fafc; }
        #infoterm-modal-content em     { color:#38bdf8;font-style:normal; }
        .info-term {
          border-bottom:2px dotted #38bdf8;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;
          transition:color 0.15s,border-color 0.15s;display:inline;white-space:nowrap;
        }
        .info-term:hover,.info-term:focus { color:#7dd3fc;border-color:#7dd3fc;outline:none; }
      `;
      const styleEl = document.createElement('style');
      styleEl.textContent = modalStyles;
      document.head.appendChild(styleEl);
      document.body.appendChild(overlay);

      const elTitle   = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-title');
      const elTag     = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-tag');
      const elContent = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-content');
      const elFWrap   = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-formula-wrap');
      const elFormula = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-formula');
      const elEWrap   = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-examples-wrap');
      const elExText  = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-examples-text');
      const elClose   = document.getElementById('infoterm-modal-close');

      function openModal(el) {
        elTitle.textContent  = el.dataset.itTitle || el.textContent.trim();
        elContent.innerHTML  = el.dataset.itContent || '';
        const tag = el.dataset.itTag || 'economy';
        elTag.textContent    = el.dataset.itTagLabel || 'Economía';
        const tagStyles = {
          economy: 'background:rgba(56,189,248,0.15);color:#7dd3fc;border-color:rgba(56,189,248,0.3)',
          legal:   'background:rgba(168,85,247,0.15);color:#c4b5fd;border-color:rgba(168,85,247,0.3)',
          tech:    'background:rgba(6,182,212,0.15);color:#67e8f9;border-color:rgba(6,182,212,0.3)',
          finance: 'background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:#6ee7b7;border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.3)',
        };
        elTag.style.cssText = tagStyles[tag] || tagStyles.economy;

        const formula = el.dataset.itFormula || '';
        if (formula) {
          if (window.katex) {
            try { elFormula.innerHTML = katex.renderToString(formula, { throwOnError: false }); }
            catch(e) { elFormula.textContent = formula; }
          } else { elFormula.textContent = formula; }
          elFWrap.style.display = 'block';
        } else { elFWrap.style.display = 'none'; }

        const examples = el.dataset.itExamples || '';
        elExText.innerHTML   = examples;
        elEWrap.style.display = examples ? 'block' : 'none';

        overlay.classList.add('is-open');
        if (window.Reveal) Reveal.configure({ keyboard: false });
        setTimeout(() => elClose.focus(), 50);
      }

      function closeModal() {
        overlay.classList.remove('is-open');
        if (window.Reveal) Reveal.configure({ keyboard: true });
      }

      elClose.addEventListener('click', closeModal);
      overlay.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === overlay) closeModal(); });
      document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        if (e.key === 'Escape' && overlay.classList.contains('is-open')) closeModal();
      });
      document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const el = e.target.closest('.info-term');
        if (el) { e.preventDefault(); e.stopPropagation(); openModal(el); }
      });
      document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        if ((e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') && e.target.classList.contains('info-term')) {
          e.preventDefault(); openModal(e.target);
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>

</body>
</html>
